  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: (36 ÷ 2) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (5 × 3 + 2).\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) 4 and 2\n\nGiven: (36 ÷ 2) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (5 × 3 + 2)\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**36 ÷ 4**__) × 5 – 15 × 2 = 20 − 260 ÷ (__**5 × 3**__ + 4)\n\n⇒ __**9 × 5**__ – __**15 × 2**__ = 20 − 260 ÷ (15 + 4)\n\n⇒ __**4**____**5 – 30**__ = 20 − __**260 ÷ 19**__\n\n⇒ 15 = __**20 − 13.7**__\n\n⇒ -15 ≠ 6.3\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) 3 and 5\n\nGiven: (36 ÷ 2) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (5 × 3 + 2)\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**36 ÷ 2**__) × 3 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (__**3 × 5**__ + 2)\n\n⇒ __**18 × 3**__ – __**15 × 4**__ = 20 − 260 ÷ (__**15 + 2**__)\n\n⇒ __**54 – 60**__ = 20 − __**260 ÷ 17**__\n\n⇒ –10 = __**20 − 15.3**__\n\n⇒ -10 ≠ 4.7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) 20 and 36\n\nGiven: (36 ÷ 2) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (5 × 3 + 2)\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**20 ÷ 2**__) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 36 − 260 ÷ (__**5 × 3**__ + 2)\n\n⇒ __**10 × 5**__ – __**15 × 4**__ = 36 − 260 ÷ (__**15 + 2**__)\n\n⇒ __**50 – 60**__ = 36 − __**260 ÷ 17**__\n\n⇒ -10 = __**36 − 15.3**__\n\n⇒ -10 ≠ -20.7\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) 2 and 3\n\nGiven: (36 ÷ 2) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (5 × 3 + 2)\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ (__**36 ÷ 3**__) × 5 – 15 × 4 = 20 − 260 ÷ (__**5 × 2**__ + 3)\n\n⇒ __**12**____** × 5**__ – __**15 × 4**__ = 20 − 260 ÷ (**__10__**__** + 3**__)\n\n⇒ __**60 – 60**__ = 20 − __**260 ÷ 13**__\n\n⇒ 0 = __**20 − 20**__\n\n⇒ 0 = 0\n\n⇒ LHS = RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".",
